                <p class="section-label">Founder Background</p>
                <h1 class="founder-title">Why Philip Ross started quickler.</h1>
                <p class="founder-standfirst">quickler did not begin as branding in search of a product. It came out of repeated delivery work across charities, publishing, and operations, where the pattern kept recurring: the facts existed, the work was real, and yet the useful output still had to be rebuilt afterwards.</p>
